WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.352 --> 00:00:02.611
- This could ruin the whole
red carpet experience for me.

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:08.629
(lively music)

00:00:08.629 --> 00:00:10.231
- Hey everyone, this is
Christian Zamora here

00:00:10.231 --> 00:00:12.158
at the Wizarding World of
Harry Potter red carpet event.

00:00:12.158 --> 00:00:13.993
I have a box full of
Bertie Bott's jelly beans,

00:00:13.993 --> 00:00:16.013
and we're gonna have the
talent who walks the carpet

00:00:16.013 --> 00:00:18.450
use this wand to grab a flavored bean.

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.239
Between you and me,
they're all really bad.

00:00:20.239 --> 00:00:22.654
Are you familiar with Bertie
Bott's jelly beans candy,

00:00:22.654 --> 00:00:24.189
in the films?
- [Billy] Yeah.

00:00:24.189 --> 00:00:25.985
- Are you gonna make me guess
their names or something?

00:00:25.985 --> 00:00:27.461
- Hello new family.

00:00:27.461 --> 00:00:29.759
They're basically jelly beans
with not so good flavors,

00:00:29.759 --> 00:00:30.688
and some good flavors.

00:00:30.688 --> 00:00:32.708
So we have a collection of both.

00:00:32.708 --> 00:00:34.512
- So this is like roulette isn't it?

00:00:34.512 --> 00:00:35.491
With beans basically.

00:00:35.491 --> 00:00:36.948
- Oh, this is so perfect.

00:00:36.948 --> 00:00:38.028
- Yes, we have a wand.

00:00:38.028 --> 00:00:39.687
You're just gonna stick it in there,

00:00:39.687 --> 00:00:41.088
and you're going to pick one up.

00:00:41.088 --> 00:00:41.870
Here we go.

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:42.834
- Oh my god.

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:43.992
- You think it's booger?

00:00:43.992 --> 00:00:44.727
- Of course.

00:00:44.727 --> 00:00:45.470
- Should I try it?

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:46.233
- Yeah.

00:00:46.233 --> 00:00:47.548
- Alright, going down.

00:00:47.548 --> 00:00:48.716
- Going down.

00:00:48.716 --> 00:00:51.845
- It looks citrus-y, but
I know it's not gonna be.

00:00:51.845 --> 00:00:53.120
- Have I got one?

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:56.660
- I think that one might be rotten egg.

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:57.587
- No.

00:00:57.587 --> 00:00:58.923
It's rotten egg.

00:00:58.923 --> 00:01:00.499
- Lettuce with sugar?

00:01:00.499 --> 00:01:02.532
And a little hint of happiness.

00:01:03.982 --> 00:01:05.566
- Wingardium Leviosa.
- [Christian] Magical.

00:01:05.566 --> 00:01:06.647
- Here we go.

00:01:06.647 --> 00:01:08.399
- It tastes like if I were to eat

00:01:08.399 --> 00:01:10.630
the latex Michael Myers mask.

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:12.077
- Let's talk about... okay.

00:01:12.077 --> 00:01:14.527
(angelic ahh)

00:01:16.917 --> 00:01:17.825
(groans)

00:01:17.825 --> 00:01:18.858
- It's booger.

00:01:18.858 --> 00:01:20.271
- [Ed] Oh no.
- Eww.

00:01:20.271 --> 00:01:22.082
- A bacon-y, sausage-y
thing, yeah. (bell dings)

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:24.570
It's not great, it's not what I expected.

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:26.072
- It looks like frog or
something, doesn't it?

00:01:26.072 --> 00:01:27.507
- It looks like frog.

00:01:27.507 --> 00:01:28.861
- Don't do that.
- [Christian] Just kidding.

00:01:28.861 --> 00:01:29.744
- Okay.

00:01:30.921 --> 00:01:32.509
I'm very trusting.

00:01:32.509 --> 00:01:34.402
- There it is, there's the aftertaste.

00:01:34.402 --> 00:01:35.760
- Wait, ready.

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:37.885
Cheers, there we go.
- [Evanna] All you.

00:01:37.885 --> 00:01:40.024
- You could do this.
- [Lydia] It looks like poo.

00:01:40.024 --> 00:01:41.287
- Do it.

00:01:41.287 --> 00:01:42.527
- [Christian] Ooh it's a red one!

00:01:44.777 --> 00:01:46.556
- [Mother] Is it good or bad?

00:01:46.556 --> 00:01:47.886
- You don't like it?

00:01:47.886 --> 00:01:49.589
- I don't think she
likes earthworm flavor.

00:01:51.129 --> 00:01:51.990
- Dirt? (bell dings)

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:52.960
- Yes! (makes dinging sounds)

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:53.667
You got dirt!

00:01:53.667 --> 00:01:54.944
That's so exciting, how fun!

00:01:54.944 --> 00:01:56.703
- Well that's better than poo.

00:01:56.703 --> 00:01:57.706
- That's great.

00:01:57.706 --> 00:01:58.567
- He loves soap.

00:01:58.567 --> 00:01:59.634
Tom Felton loves soap.

00:01:59.634 --> 00:02:00.481
Good to know.

00:02:00.481 --> 00:02:02.390
Alright, thanks.

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:03.763
(squeaking hinge)

